  "title": "Shadows in the Ledger",
  "subtitle": "The High Quarter Vaults",
  "summary": "Slipping back through a night alley, Torrik partners with Senior Archivist Ilvar to verify Fennick's duplicate books.",
  "startNode": "c3_start",
  "nextChapterId": "chapter_04",
  "nodes": {
    "c3_start": {
